    <string name="about_text">Toolbox is a set of home-screen widgets for Samsung (One UI) and other Android phones. Add them from the widget list on your home screen, and set them up here.\n\nExchange rate: rates come from free public sources (Coinbase, falling back to currency-api and ExchangeRate-API). They are mid-market reference rates, not bank or trading quotes.\n\nRoutine timer: records when you last did each routine. Stored only on this phone, never sent anywhere.</string>
